                    "content": "```kotlin\nimport java.util.Scanner\n\nconst val MOD = 1_000_000_007L\n\nfun modpow(base: Long, exp: Long, mod: Long): Long {\n    var b = base % mod\n    if (b < 0) b += mod\n    var e = exp\n    var result = 1L\n    while (e > 0) {\n        if (e and 1L == 1L) {\n            result = (result * b) % mod\n        }\n        b = (b * b) % mod\n        e = e shr 1\n    }\n    return result\n}\n\nfun main() {\n    val br = System.`in`.bufferedReader()\n    val line = br.readLine().trim().split(\" \")\n    val x = line[0].toLong()\n    val n = line[1].toLong()\n\n    // factorize x\n    val primes = mutableListOf<Long>()\n    var xx = x\n    var d = 2L\n    while (d * d <= xx) {\n        if (xx % d == 0L) {\n            primes.add(d)\n            while (xx % d == 0L) {\n                xx /= d\n            }\n        }\n        d++\n    }\n    if (xx > 1) {\n        primes.add(xx)\n    }\n\n    var answer = 1L\n    val phi = MOD - 1\n\n    for (p in primes) {\n        var e = 0L\n        var cur = p\n        while (cur <= n) {\n            e += n / cur\n            if (cur > n / p) break\n            cur *= p\n        }\n        val expMod = e % phi\n        val pw = modpow(p % MOD, expMod, MOD)\n        answer = (answer * pw) % MOD\n    }\n\n    println(answer)\n}\n```",
